            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There is `vim.lsp.buf.code_action()` which uses `vim.ui.select`. It will use 'mini.pick' if `vim.ui.select` is set to use `MiniPick.ui_select`. Also see #1169 for more details.\n\nClosing as not planned.",
